const e={yingshe:{bibi:"Spot",bibidingdan:"Spot Orders",bibijiaoyi:"Spot Trading",jiamihuobi:"Perpetual Contracts",miaoheyue:"Delivery Contracts",miaoheyuejiaoyi:"Delivery Contract Trading"},jiaoyi:{xianhuomingcheng:"Spot Name"},aurexion:{jianguanwenjian:"Regulatory Documents"},rwa_283:{jiaru:"Join RWA Now",biaoti:"Ultra-low fees, excellent security, high trading limits, and top-notch support",xiazai:"Download App",jiaoyiliang:"24H Volume",guanyu:"About RWA",guanyuxiangqing:"RWA is one of the world's leading providers of investment, advisory, and risk management solutions. We are a fiduciary to our clients. We're busy helping clients invest for their future, inspiring our employees, and supporting local communities. Watch the video to learn more.",jieshao:"Ranked as the World’s Most Admired Company by Fortune magazine",jieshaoxiangqing:"We are honored to be included in Fortune magazine’s “World’s Most Admired Companies” list for the 12th consecutive year, ranking first in the securities and asset management industry.",weishenme:"Why Choose RWA?",weishenmexiangqing:"An increasing number of investors trust RWA, largely because we offer more choices than any other company in the industry. Our global platform is designed to help our clients better achieve their most important financial goals.",weishenmexiangqing1:"RWA has seen net inflows of $1.8 trillion over the past 5 years",weishenmexiangqing2:"We help over 35 million Americans invest and save for retirement",weishenmexiangqing3:"Over 190,000 financial advisors in the U.S. choose RWA to help clients build their portfolios",huoban:"Partners",huobanxiangqing:"In recent years, RWA has actively invested in the field of artificial intelligence (AI), establishing partnerships with many AI companies, covering infrastructure investment, chip technology, data analysis, and sustainable development. Here are some major cooperation projects:",huoban1:"Global AI Infrastructure Investment Partnership (AIP)",huoban11:"In September 2024, RWA, Microsoft, Mubadala, and GIP jointly launched the 'Global AI Infrastructure Investment Partnership' (AIP), aiming to invest over $30 billion in infrastructure and expand to about $100 billion through innovative financing. In March 2025, NVIDIA and xAI (founded by ElonMusk) joined the partnership, further enhancing the technology solution. GE Vernova, NextEra Energy, and others are also involved, committed to providing diversified energy solutions for global AI infrastructure.",huoban2:"Investment in AI chip startup Groq",huoban22:"In August 2024, RWA led a $640 million funding round for Groq, raising its valuation to $2.8 billion. Groq focuses on developing new high-performance processors (LPU) for AI inference and plans to ship over 1.5 million chips by 2025. The company has already partnered with Meta, Samsung, and others, aiming to maintain its leading position in the AI chip market.",huoban3:"Investment in AI analytics company Pyramid Analytics",huoban33:"In November 2024, RWA invested $50 million in AI business analytics company Pyramid Analytics. Pyramid's analytics platform uses AI to enhance learning and decision-making, helping clients such as Citi, Deloitte, and Bank of China optimize their data processes. This investment reflects RWA's ongoing commitment to expanding its AI-related business.",huoban4:"Strategic partnership with Clarity AI",huoban44:"Since 2021, RWA has invested in Clarity AI, a sustainability assessment platform, and integrated its functions into RWA's investment management platform Aladdin. Clarity AI uses AI technology for ESG, disclosure assessment, and social impact measurement, helping investors assess the sustainability and social impact of their portfolios.",huoban5:"Through the above cooperation, RWA has not only accelerated investment in AI infrastructure and chip technology, but also deepened its layout in data analysis and sustainable development, RWAnstrating its strategic ambition in the AI ecosystem.",chongti:"Fast Deposit & Withdrawal",chongtixiangqing:"Multiple common payment channels, support fast deposit and withdrawal",huanying:"Welcome to experience RWA service",baipishu:"White Paper",chengyuandengjice:"Register of Members",gongsizhangcheng:"Articles of Association",gupiaozhengshu:"Share Certificate",huiyijilu:"Meeting Minutes",zhucezhengshu:"Certificate of Incorporation",shuihao:"Tax Identification Number",weijiaoyiersheng:"Born for Trading",guanlianzhanghu:"Linked Account",yizhixingdingdan:"Executed Orders",xinwen:"News",cishan:"Charity",efepeishou:"ETF Allocation",rineijiaoyi:"Intraday Trading"}};export{e as default};
